{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/A1welcome.png?t=1743338359\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/A1what.png?t=1743338359\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Art of Blades is a top-down, hand-drawn hack-and-slash adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">inspired by Japanese manga and anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/A1gameplay.png?t=1743338359\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a fast-paced hack-and-slash action, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">every swing of your weapon brings excitement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Can you become a master of combat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/A1enemies.png?t=1743338359\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will face many different enemies in this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Each enemy has unique traits, so you will need different strategies to defeat them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you outsmart them in quick combat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/A1world.png?t=1743338359\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a stunning fantasy world where the beauty of feudal Japan meets  sci-fi. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here, robots and magic exist side by side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the secrets of this vibrant world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/A1hero.png?t=1743338359\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will play as a Wanderer seeking  &quot;inspiration&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Your adventure begins when you encounter an S.O.S. Droid,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> leading you into thrilling experiences in Art of Blades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What challenges await you on your journey? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Art of Blades is an original intellectual property of SamueleRS.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2883740?t=1743338359","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743338359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/04d6d06f8066b9dbf0e78d9843f4171ff318432f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743338359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/04d6d06f8066b9dbf0e78d9843f4171ff318432f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743338359","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/A1welcome.png?t=1743338359\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/A1what.png?t=174333835